Presence of this file opts the project into the protoblast plugin's checkJavaLooks compile
gate (production Java writing a look property into an element's inline style, or a literal
color into any CSS it builds, paints outside the stylesheet where the design tokens, the
theme and the color scheme never reach it; Java writes geometry only, and StyleProperty
declares which property plays which role; see CheckJavaLooksTask). No comment
excuses a look.
